; RIFT BOSS POOL (sl-0180): HELIX ARMS — a two-arm star spiral. ROTOR
; world-frame base advances 1.3°/tick, so each chunky volley (three
; staggered speeds per arm) precesses across the fight; the gaps
; between arms are the answer and they WALK. Playful-space shape,
; fairness floor intact: deterministic, bot-projected, one lead.
; Pattern id 30; lead 36 (the radial danger class). Elite amber.

